In-Reply-To: <hMy74-Cfe5w.1QQ7vDSskuoJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <hMy74-Cfe5w.1QQ7vDSskuoJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/hMy74-Cfe5w/m/B0h2HZrvBLkJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
